<title>JAPAN: Asahi Chemical, Hoechst agree on veterinary tie-up.</title>
<headline>Asahi Chemical, Hoechst agree on veterinary tie-up.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Chemical Industry Co Ltd said on Wednesday it would form a business alliance with Germany's Hoechst Roussel Vet GmbH and to distribute the company's veterinary products in Japan.</p>
<p>Hoechst Roussel, a member of the group lead by Hoechst AG, is expected to acquire 50 percent of Asahi Chemical unit Mitaka Pharmaceutical Co Ltd by 2000, Asahi Chemical said in a statement.</p>
<p>Mitaka Pharmaceutical is currently 51 percent owned by Asahi Chemical and 49 percent owned by Mitaka chairman Shohei Setoguchi and his family, Asahi said.</p>
</text>
